msgid ""
"Stored for legacy XEP-0027/keyserver, but not active while OpenPGP for XMPP "
"mode is selected."
msgstr ""
"Gemt til ældre XEP-0027/nøgleserver, men ikke aktiv, mens tilstanden OpenPGP"
